          "text": "“Were it not so, the Holy Ghost could not dwell in us.”"
        },
        {
          "id": "o2",
          "text": "Because the Holy Ghost is not a member of the Godhead"
        },
        {
          "id": "o3",
          "text": "Because only the Father has a body"
        },
        {
          "id": "o4",
          "text": "The verse gives no reason"
